    "body": "See also #776. I suppose we could have a section to that effect, to make it explicit nothing is known.\r\n\r\nSince DOM is pretty old, security and privacy researchers have already studied it a lot, as well as browser security and privacy teams. Feel free to review it again though. I'm personally not aware of any issues.",
