    "updated_at": "2021-09-01T15:57:36Z",
    "body": "Thanks, I recommend being explicit about this so future reviewers and implementers know what they should keep in mind when they read the spec. In this case, there aren't any concerns, but knowing this is not obvious and requires either being an expert (and knowing the history/community) or searching through old Github issues.\r\n\r\nThanks for reconsidering this request.",
