    "updated_at": "2021-09-01T19:24:45Z",
    "body": "It might be a matter of misaligned expectations, not confusion.\r\n\r\nPING (in the case of privacy) and I (as coordinator of W3C security reviews) expect that work from all who ask us to review documents. Technically, I suppose, these particular review requests come from the W3C HTML WG, even though they asked us to file issues over here, in WHATWG repos.  Hopefully they will help us sort through the misalignment.",
